{{documentation|git=true}}

Renders a [https://doc.wikimedia.org/codex/latest/components/demos/button.html Codex] button as a link: a fake-button <code><nowiki><span></nowiki></code> wrapping a wikilink or external link, with optional icon, action, weight, and size variants.

Required by [[Module:CardLua]], [[Module:Mainpage/Community]], [[Module:Mainpage/Editing]], [[Module:Entity/Infobox]], [[Module:Company]], and [[Module:Documentation]]; not invoked from templates.

== For module editors ==

=== API ===

<code><nowiki>p.render(props)</nowiki></code> returns an HTML string with <code><nowiki><templatestyles></nowiki></code> for [[Module:ButtonLua/styles.css]] included.

